{
  "id": "dialogue.mamimi.purple",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "Purple Haze",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mamimi.purple",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mamimi.purple",
    "idolId": "mamimi",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "别说这种让人误会的话……！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……话说，刚才有粉丝和你说话吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "是啊ー。就像制作人偷看到的那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……看起来聊得挺开心的。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "是ー吗……大概是错觉吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……刚才那个孩子说，她在参考我的搭配ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……那真是太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "没什么ー…………",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "啊，对了ー……刚才那个孩子，我给她签名了ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "最近，我觉得自己签得比以前好了ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，是吗。要签名的机会也多了，是熟练了。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "能看到摩美々的成长，我也很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……制作人不想看看，我成长了多少吗ー？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "这样啊ー……ふふー……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎、怎么了？那个笑法……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……今天的制作人，穿着白色的衬衫呢ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "签起来应该很有价值ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "我啊，最近都随身带着签名笔哦ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "因为不知道什么时候会被要签名嘛ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "摩、摩美々……？我之后还有重要的会议……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "没关系ー。也算帮我自己宣传，一石二鸟不是吗ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "别、别过来──！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "啊…………跑掉了……ふふー。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "…………就算我成长了，也不能大意哦ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "制作人要是发呆，我还会再恶作剧的ー。"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（最近的流行是这样的吗……为了以后参考，得看看。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯？站在那边的是……）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "──谢谢ー。我会适当地努力的ー。ふふー。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "摩美々，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……あれー，制作人？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "为什么在这种地方？该不会ー……是我的跟踪狂？",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不不，不是。工作间隙碰巧经过。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "はぁ。所以就是发现了我，然后一直在偷看吧ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
